## Hardware

The prototype uses the following components:

| Component | Purpose |
|---|---|
| Piezoelectric Transducers | Detection of structural mechanical response |
| PCF8591 ADC | Conversion of analogue sensor signals |
| GY-87 / MPU6050 | Acceleration and inertial measurements |
| Raspberry Pi Zero 2 W | Data acquisition and processing |
| LoRa SX1278 / Ra-02 | Wireless data transmission |
| NodeMCU ESP8266 | Receiving and processing LoRa data |
| RGB LED | Receiver status indication |
| LM2596 | Voltage regulation |

The report documents the individual hardware components and their intended functions in the prototype. :chatgpt-content-reference{index="2"}

