between healthy and unhealthy structures.

It also generates anomaly-score distributions for the Isolation Forest and LOF models.

The visualisation provides a way to inspect differences in the behaviour of the two datasets and to examine the distribution of the anomaly scores. :chatgpt-content-reference{index="11"}

