## Results

The analysis presented in the report shows differences between the healthy and unhealthy datasets.

### Current

The unhealthy dataset shows greater fluctuations and higher peaks compared with the healthy dataset.

### Voltage

The voltage values remain relatively stable in both datasets, although differences between the two datasets can be observed.

### Stress

The unhealthy dataset shows more noticeable peaks and fluctuations in stress.

### Strain

The strain values remain relatively close between the datasets, but the unhealthy data shows greater variation.

In general, the report observes smoother and more consistent behaviour in the healthy dataset, while the unhealthy dataset contains greater fluctuations and variation. :chatgpt-content-reference{index="12"}

